abstract: >-
  Identification, exact CDF-band minimax decisions, and decision-aware
  inventory exploration under censored feedback. Paired synthetic and
  FreshRetailNet-calibrated experiments with classical statistical baselines.
  Software and dataset licensing are separate; the external dataset is CC BY 4.0.
